exports[`bounds student choices and usage, and writes settled costs and attempts to both machine formats > exported usage records and cost summary 1`] = `
{
  "README.txt": "Marea session export, format 1

Times use UTC. Date filters select session opening time; the end is exclusive.
Active sessions are a consistent snapshot at download time, not a live feed.

conversations/: readable Markdown; events.jsonl: stored events and session headers;
usage.jsonl: model attempts, recorded times and policy cost units; sessions.csv: summary.
Missing usage is null/blank, not zero. Totals include only settled attempts and may be partial.
Cost units are estimates under the session policy, not a provider invoice.
Truncated content remains marked; old clients may not have captured model or tool details.

Pseudonyms replace identity fields in the export. Free text, code, paths and conversation
content can still identify people: this is NOT an anonymous dataset. Review before sharing.
No server configuration, credentials or session authentication tokens are included.
",
  "conversations/session-1.md": "# Marea session

    s1
    one
    Synthetic project

Opened: 2026-09-07T12:00:00.000Z

Closed: still open

## 1. assistant-message · 2026-09-07T12:00:00.000Z

    Canonical 1

## 2. assistant-message · 2026-09-07T12:00:00.000Z

    Canonical 2
",
